Audience group profile template
title end

paragraph start
One profile per group, one group per page. A profile page is created in this folder when a group is chosen.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Facts come from the research methods in this area. A field with no fact stays marked unknown and is never filled with a guess.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
group name
shared problem
what they want
where they spend time
words they use
what stops them acting
what makes them act
how many exist, as an estimate
source of each fact
code end

